/** Complete scorecard of a cricket fixture: every innings, each with a batting card and a bowling card. The ball-by-ball picture (striker, bowler, the over in progress) comes from /v2/fixtures/{id}/events. For other sports the response is 200 with `{ innings: [] }` rather than 404. */

